"\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHere is the location of the Bus Papercraft Solo Seedling in Anyang-si, Gyeonggi-do in October 2026, around autumn.  \n\nIf it does not appear as a solo seedling, try turning on  and moving around the area little by little.\n\nOverall, quite a few solo seedlings seem to appear around Anyang.  \n\nIf you explore around Anyang City Hall, you can also occasionally find Roadside solo seedlings, so keep that in mind.\n\n\n\n\n"